WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.600
This is FlowForge, a visual E T L workstation that runs in your browser.

2
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:19.400
It boots like a nineteen-eighties terminal, then draws a real pipeline: three thousand two hundred orders, deduplicated, filtered, and rolled up into ninety-two days of revenue.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.500
In the workstation, every step runs on DuckDB in your browser, and shows its rows and schema as you build.

4
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:38.967
Select a step to see exactly what it produces, then export the whole pipeline as SQL, Pie Spark, or a d b t project.

5
00:00:39.567 --> 00:00:46.300
That's FlowForge, built by Aditya Malviya. Try it live, at the link below.
